{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29459","headline":"碧城三首 二 · 李商隐","name":"碧城三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"对影闻声已可怜，玉池荷叶正田田。\n不逢萧史休回首，莫见洪崖又拍肩。\n紫凤放娇衔楚佩，赤鳞狂舞拨湘弦。\n鄂君怅望舟中夜，绣被焚香独自眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29459.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29459","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}